        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXhUNar4V8gJ64lv3lDa0WHF-CrvJqUbOBWYkxXdjgwd9QzMjv6=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We rented a Sperry tent for a wedding and it was simply amazing! The set-up and tear down went super smoothly and we got so many compliments from our guests. The tent was set up a day before historical amounts of rain, and it never budged an inch throughout the torrential rain - we were so impressed. We highly recommend Sperry!",
        "time": 1724163193,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Catherine C.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102434740989729466210/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJjlKavaghyy9OziGoNgknYzwJAWvTllwmxuNHC5kRrd1W79w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We rented a Sperry tent at the last minute due to the unpredictable weather. We knew of Sperry's reputation for quality, but our personal experience confirmed the excellence of their service and product. From our first contact (five days before the wedding), Jeff did everything he could to accommodate us despite the very high demand. Two days later, at 7:00 pm, Jeff and Christian arrived to begin setting up the tent before the extreme rainfall forecast for the following day. With reinforcements from the team, the tent was erected in just a few hours. The efficiency of the installers, their friendliness, and the stunning beauty of the tent allowed us to enjoy our meal outdoors, as the bride and groom had wished, in the comfort and majesty of the illuminated Sperry tent. A huge thank you to the entire team!",
        "time": 1723830584,
        "translated": true
      }
